        "A dashboard showing $1,000 in sales does not mean $1,000 in profit.\n2.1 A practical order-level profit model\nFor each order, estimate:\nItem\tExample\tNotes\nSelling price\t$49.00\tAmount charged before any applicable tax treatment\nProduct and supplier cost\t$14.00\tInclude product cost and supplier handling\nShipping cost\t$5.00\tInclude any shipping subsidy\nPayment/platform fees\t$2.00\tActual fees vary by provider and country\nRefund/chargeback allowance\t$2.00\tPlanning reserve, not a guaranteed expense\nContribution before ads\t$26.00\tSelling price less variable non-ad costs\nAdvertising cost per purchase\t$16.00\tActual CPA from the campaign\nContribution after ads\t$10.00\tBefore fixed overhead and income taxes",
