        "For a beginner, a lower-risk product with a simple, demonstrable, non-medical use case may be a more appropriate first test.\n5.1 Write the customer problem in one sentence\nUse this format:\n“For [specific customer], this product helps with [specific everyday problem or task] by [verifiable mechanism or feature].”",
