  "closingParagraphs": [
    "Closing principle: The useful lesson from the challenge is not that AI makes anyone $1,000 in a day. It is that AI can compress parts of the ecommerce workflow: product research, page drafting, creative production, and analysis. The hard work remains deciding what deserves to be sold, proving that the offer is credible, acquiring customers at a sustainable cost, and delivering what was promised.",
    "Treat the 24-hour target as a focused experiment. Treat every dollar spent as capital that needs a reason. Build around evidence, honest marketing, sound unit economics, and reliable fulfilment. A store that makes a few profitable, well-served sales is a stronger foundation than a store with impressive revenue screenshots and no understanding of its actual profit."
  ]
